# Local development env for `wrangler dev` (project-level).
# Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in real values. `.dev.vars` is gitignored.
# In production, connection values are Worker secrets and the optional topology
# hub is a GitHub environment variable.
API_BACKEND_URL="http://127.0.0.1:8000"
SUPABASE_URL=""
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=""
INTERNAL_API_SECRET="replace-with-the-same-local-value-as-the-backend"
TOPOLOGY_HUB_NODE="hub"
